  "prefLabel": "Hedc 211.02 Standard and Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hedc 211.02 Standard and Burden of Proof. The party asserting a proposition shall bear the burden of proving the truth of the proposition by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #14403, eff 10-15-25",
